    <briefdescription>
<para>Aggregates the toolbox and its auto-wired bridge instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Fields are set according to the sinks provided to the builder:</para>
<para><table rows="4" cols="2"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Field  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Condition  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1toolbox" kindref="compound">toolbox</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Always non-null.  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_builder_1_1_built_toolbox_1a8da5ed014e70c466d167a860558ad3a1" kindref="member">aql_bridge</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Non-null when a graph-writer was registered.  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_builder_1_1_built_toolbox_1a65137058ba1d91ff4fc86fb9b3809929" kindref="member">rag_bridge</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Non-null when a vector-writer or graph-writer was set.  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
